# AUDIT-3 MINOR-1: DEPLOY.md's own local-testing instructions (`export PROFILE_YAML="$(cat
# ~/profile.yaml)"`) have the operator keep a plaintext copy of the full private profile on
# disk, by convention outside the repo — this stops it from being swept up by a routine
# `git add -A` if it's ever dropped inside the repo directory instead, for convenience.
profile.yaml
